classDiagram
    class MainGame {
        +main() : None
        +process_request(connector: MCPConnector, user_input: str) : str
        +print_help() : None
        +render_room(text: str) : None
        +render_inventory(text: str) : None
        +render_glossary(text: str) : None
        +render_response(text: str) : None
        +render_fog_manifestation(text: str) : None
        +_is_room_output(text: str) : bool
        +_extract_manifestation(text: str) : tuple[str, str | None]
    }

    class MCPConnector {
        +connect() : AsyncContextManager
        +call_tool(tool_name: str, arguments: dict) : ToolResult
        +get_tools_description() : str
    }

    class ToolResult {
        +success : bool
        +output : str
        +error : str | None
    }

    class OllamaClient {
        +ask_ollama(user_message: str, tools_description: str) : dict | None
        +format_result(tool_name: str, result: str) : str
        +classify_phone_choice(user_input: str) : str
        +classify_photo_choice(user_input: str) : str
    }

    class RichConsole {
        +print() : None
        +print(Panel) : None
        +print(Table) : None
        +print(Markdown) : None
    }

    class GameState {
        +awaiting_phone_choice : bool
        +awaiting_photo_choice : bool
        +connector : MCPConnector
    }

    class HelpCommand {
        +table : Table
        +commands : dict
    }

    MainGame --> MCPConnector : verwendet
    MainGame --> OllamaClient : importiert & nutzt
    MainGame --> RichConsole : nutzt (global)
    MainGame --> GameState : verwaltet (lokal in main)
    MainGame --> HelpCommand : nutzt (print_help)
    
    MCPConnector --> ToolResult : erzeugt
    
    OllamaClient ..> MainGame : async aufruf (process_request)
    
    note for MainGame "Hauptschleife:\n- User Input verarbeiten\n- State-Machine für Choice\n- Rendering verschiedener Ausgaben"
    note for GameState "Flags:\n- awaiting_phone_choice\n- awaiting_photo_choice"
    note for HelpCommand "Hilfetabelle mit\nverfügbaren Befehlen"